  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  TTestP
  @  Paired samples: tests whether the mean difference is zero.
  @  Author & design           : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "TTestP: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → nv dbv sdv « nv 0 + dbv 0 + sdv 0 + → nn dbar sdd « 'dbar/(sdd/√(nn))' →Num 'nn-1' →Num → tv dfv « tv "t" →Tag dfv "df" →Tag dfv 'ABS(tv)' →Num UTPT 2 * "p" →Tag nv dbv sdv 3 →List Drop » » »
